{#-
  toggle-widget.njk — pill-button bar for the four-mode content toggle.

  Emits the widget chrome only — button bar, hint text, ARIA live region.
  Does NOT carry [data-mode-root]; that lives on the page-level wrapper in
  finance-taxation/index.md so the mode-show CSS cascade reaches all sibling
  partials (framing-block, profile-card, etc.).

  IMPORTANT — no blank lines inside the <div class="toggle-widget"> block.
  This partial is included into a Markdown (.md) file. CommonMark type-6 HTML
  blocks terminate at the first blank line, so blank lines inside the div would
  cause subsequent elements to be processed as Markdown and escaped. All button
  elements are single-line; no blank lines between sibling elements.

  State contract (written by toggle-widget.js on the [data-mode-root] ancestor):
    [data-mode]   = "synthesis" | "design" | "gap" | "neutral"
    [data-design] = "on" | "off"
    [data-gap]    = "on" | "off"

  JS file: src/assets/js/toggle-widget.js — loaded via empower.njk with defer.
-#}
<div class="toggle-widget" role="group" aria-labelledby="toggle-widget-label">
<span class="toggle-widget__label" id="toggle-widget-label">Show:</span>
<button class="pill" data-toggle="design" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-describedby="toggle-widget-label">Show design aspects</button>
<button class="pill" data-toggle="gap" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-describedby="toggle-widget-label">Show gap aspects</button>
<span class="toggle-widget__hint" aria-hidden="true">Both on: synthesis. One off: focus that lens. Both off: neutral analytical.</span>
<div class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-mode-announce></div>
</div>
